# Accepted-risk advisory denylist — scanned by Trivy (security.yml) and by
# scripts/audit-gate.mjs (daily-security.yml), so BOTH gates share one list.
#
# Rationale (see docs/audits/SECURITY-AUDIT.md §4): these advisories all
# affect the build-time CSS toolchain (postcss bundled inside next, and the
# tailwindcss 3.x chain) which processes DEVELOPER-AUTHORED CSS at build
# time only — never request data. The only vendor fixes require breaking
# majors (next@16, tailwindcss@4) and are tracked as TD-P2-04.
#
# A NEW advisory not listed here still fails both gates.
# Review this list when upgrading next/tailwind. Last review: 2026-10-23.

